              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="M" typeId="c100-b9db-eacc-d3e0">6&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="T" typeId="4e8c-3287-4126-05a4">6</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="SR" typeId="55e5-4318-7023-255d">3+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="W" typeId="7547-1a30-8027-a225">3</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="OC" typeId="17b7-6486-cf25-b101">2</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="MF" typeId="dbfc-7c96-dcff-d55b">6</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="CC" typeId="f4e7-dd5b-6bb4-6485">3</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Divine Champions" typeId="fe4c-5b77-ab77-e578" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="81ca-e3d0-e074-d0ae">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5cee-5283-c95d-c323">During your Charge Phase, after selecting your Charge target but before making a Charge roll, you may issue a Challenge. To issue a Challenge, select one ability from the Challenge table below, that ability is active until the end of your turn.

**Despite All Odds**
If any model in the target unit has a greater Toughness characteristic than any model in this unit, all of this unit&apos;s weapons receive the Lethal Hits keyword. However, if the target unit scores a Critical Hit when making an attack against this unit, automatically inflict 1 Mortal Wound. 

**I Feel Quite Hungry**
The target unit always fights first regardless of Close Combat value, but any missed hit rolls of 1 they confer automatically inflict 1 Mortal Wound to that target unit.

**Their Best is Not Good Enough**
All models in the target unit receive a +1 to their hit rolls, but all melee weapons in this unit receive an improvement of 1 to their Attacks characteristic.


If this unit declares a Challenge against another unit, but fails the Charge Roll, the target unit may perform a Shooting Attack against this unit using one of its Ranged Weapon profiles.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <selectionEntryGroups>
            <selectionEntryGroup name="Wargear" id="c6a6-f297-c8bd-8c29" hidden="false">
              <entryLinks>
                <entryLink import="true" name="Main Hand" hidden="false" id="6683-a61b-6abb-99e5" type="selectionEntryGroup" targetId="da81-c21c-49af-fba4">
