          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5cee-5283-c95d-c323">Enemy units within 3&quot; of this unit receive a -6&quot; to the Range Characteristic of their Ranged Weapons (to a minimum of 1&quot;), a -1 to hit rolls when making attacks with Ranged Weapons, and a -1 to their Movement Characteristic.</characteristic>
